{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"6161","name":"玛赫菲【学者】","desc":"玛赫菲【学者】","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/02/27/192134014/c20e723e43b0facef14b6e5afffc2de0_6371436360063806291.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"玛赫菲","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"女\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"须弥城\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"职业\",\"value\":[\"学者\"]}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"心声：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e还是和植物打交道比较简单⋯\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"编者注：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e去散散心吧，想开点。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/02/27/192134014/59d60e328a2431b7c0f8991c6918d047_7051633001727269188.jpg\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"NPC截图\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/02/27/192134014/dfd8e15dcceef0dcc485403d59cdd308_1349062471928691498.jpg\"},{\"tab_name\":\"位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/02/27/192134014/abda27fa53a7462ba3e59d068a2242ec_6037383092951925903.jpg\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"商品列表","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e学者的生活，也不止研究课题这么简单哪⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【怎么了？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e抱歉，让你听到了我的抱怨。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e我只是在感慨，学者也不止需要潜心研究，还得处理其他方面的工作。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e比如教令院的安排，导师的任务，同僚之间的关系⋯甚至偶尔还有风纪官的盘查。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e唉，如果这些事情能和植物开枝散叶一样自然天成就好了⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e现在，我多多少少明白提纳里学长为什么会离开教令院了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【再见。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e单纯的生活一去不返⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:22px\\\"\u003e 【第一次学院庆典（2023）期间】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e没想到，一向不太在城里出现的提纳里学长竟然同意参加学院争霸赛。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e以我对学长的了解，他不像是追名逐利的人···可能是推选他的人太多了，学长不愿驳大家的面子吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e啊，说到这个，提纳里学长似乎后面有办新讲座的计划。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e一定要记下讲座时间···干万不能错过了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\",\"list\":[]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1212","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1762236700","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},